                "text": "Well I'll be damned...I agree with @elonmusk!\n@realDonaldTrump and @SpeakerJohnson\u2019s plan would rip healthcare from 14 million Americans and slash SNAP benefits for millions of working families. This bill must be stopped\u2014our future depends on it.",
